    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "info",
      "text": "**DATEDIF** finds the difference between two dates in completed years, months or days: `=DATEDIF(start, end, unit)`. The start date must come before the end date, and the unit is written in quotes: `\"Y\"` for whole years, `\"M\"` for whole months, or `\"D\"` for days."
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "type": "select",
      "prompt": "A community centre tracks members and their ages. Select Aarav's date of birth and the as-of date: `B2:C2`.",
